---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Export Services & Logistics | Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd."
  description="Full-service green coffee dry milling, optical sorting, GrainPro packaging, and bonded export logistics from Kampala to the Port of Mombasa under simulated UCDA supervision."
>
  <!-- Page Header with Background Image -->
  <div 
    class="relative text-white py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-stone-800 bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.78) 0%, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.90) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447933601403-0c6688de566e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-600/40 text-[10px] text-amber-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
          <span>LOGISTICS WORKFLOW</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-serif tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Dry Milling, Quality Grading, and Port Transit
        </h1>
        <p class="text-stone-200 text-sm sm:text-base mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          From receiving dried parchment at our Plot 45 Industrial Area facility to sealing 20ft ocean containers bound for the Port of Mombasa, our processing infrastructure adheres to strict international export standards.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Milling Process Steps -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block mb-2">
          THE MILLING WORKFLOW
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight">
          Precision Processing: Step-by-Step
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Every kilogram of green coffee undergoes rigorous multi-stage physical cleaning, size classification, and optical sorting prior to bagging.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-4 reveal-on-scroll">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-coffee-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 01</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Intake & Moisture Screening</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Parchment and dried pods are sampled at intake bays. Moisture levels must test below 13.0 percent before unloading into dry storage silos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-4 reveal-on-scroll delay-100">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-coffee-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 02</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Pre-Cleaning & Destoning</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            High-volume aspirators and vibratory destoners isolate heavy foreign matter, stones, soil clods, and light organic debris before entering the huller.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-4 reveal-on-scroll delay-200">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-coffee-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 03</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Secondary Hulling & Polishing</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Gentle cross-beater hullers crack and separate outer parchment and silverskin without generating friction heat or cracking fragile green coffee embryos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-4 reveal-on-scroll">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-coffee-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 04</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Mechanical Screen Grading</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Multi-deck oscillating screen separators sort green beans into precise size categories: Screen 18 (7.14mm), Screen 17 (6.75mm), Screen 15 (6.00mm), and round PB peaberry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-4 reveal-on-scroll delay-100">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-coffee-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 05</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Density Gravity Separation</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Fluidized air bed gravity tables float lighter, insect-bitten, or immature seeds away from heavy, nutrient-dense beans, ensuring uniform roasting dynamics.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 6 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 space-y-4 reveal-on-scroll delay-200">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-coffee-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 06</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Optical Bichromatic Sorting</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Optical color sorters scan bean surfaces. High-pressure air ejectors reject black beans, partial sours, foxy beans, and insect-damaged defects.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Export Packaging & Container Logistics -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-t border-stone-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block">
            MARITIME LOGISTICS
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Corridor Transit to the Port of Mombasa
          </h2>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Ugandan coffee moves along the Northern Transport Corridor via Malaba to the deep-water Port of Mombasa, Kenya. We coordinate directly with bonded container carriers and international shipping lines to guarantee transit security.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
              <div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900">FCL Container Stuffing at Plot 45</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1">
                Containers are inspected, lined with Kraft moisture barrier paper or desiccant bags, and loaded directly inside our Kampala warehouse bays.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
              <div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900">GrainPro Hermetic Export Bags</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1">
                All specialty Arabica lots are double-bagged with 50-micron hermetic GrainPro liners inside new 60kg jute bags, preserving fresh cup scores across oceanic voyages.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
              <div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900">Tamper-Evident Bolt Seals</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1">
                Export inspectors witness container sealing and affix high-security bolt seals before trucks depart for the border.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Documentation Checklist Box -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-6">
          <div class="border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block">TRADE COMPLIANCE</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 mt-1">Export Document Package</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Every export shipment is accompanied by a full legal document set required for customs clearance at European, North American, and Asian destination ports:
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700">
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>UCDA Quality and Inspection Certificate</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>International Coffee Organization (ICO) Certificate of Origin</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Ministry of Agriculture Phytosanitary Certificate</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Clean On Board Ocean Bill of Lading (B/L)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Commercial Invoice and Detailed Packing List</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>EUDR Geolocation Data File & Due Diligence Statement</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-200">
            <a
              href="/quote"
              class="block w-full py-3 rounded-full text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-[#A35326] hover:bg-[#8E431B] transition-colors"
            >
              Inquire Regarding Export Contracts
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
